## Missing-Chemical Impact and Preparation

Immortelle Absolute has current composite decomposition coverage, but Helichrysum EO is not registered to its constituent model even though a constituent list exists; strict composite OAV and release advancement are therefore on hold. Recover the three percentage-stock receipts and verify EB before mixing. Do not buy more immortelle, hay, maple, tobacco, balsam, or musk; keep all tinctures excluded.

## Controlled Blinded Test Plan

After stock-basis verification, compare coded equal-mass, equal-concentration LN-05, LN-01, and a carrier-matched immortelle-module omission control in balanced order at 0, 5, and 30 minutes and 2 and 4 hours. Judge immortelle identity, cardamom authority, lavender-to-cedar continuity, curry/maple/gourmand drift, and liking. No physical result exists.

## Claim Ceiling

Physical liking, sensory similarity, stability, and measured headspace are `NOT TESTED`; safety and release are `NOT CLEARED`.

